<title>SWEDEN: Saab Nov U.S. car sales up 37 pct.</title>
<headline>Saab Nov U.S. car sales up 37 pct.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish car maker Saab Automobile AB said on Wednesday its U.S. sales rose 37 percent in November to 1,878 cars compared with November 1995.</p>
</text>
